{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53411","headline":"过秦松岭 · 林藴","name":"过秦松岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散发长林下，松风入太清。\n空山容暮色，落叶起秋声。\n世险江天窄，云深草木平。\n从兹归故土，勿作失羣鸣。\n（《闽诗录甲集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}